{"id":"68a0e385f198060c","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheafification-idempotence.md","title":"Theorem — Sheafification is Idempotent","display":"Theorem — Sheafification is Idempotent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheafification-idempotence","aliases":["14-thm-sheafification-idempotence"],"display":"Theorem — Sheafification is Idempotent","depends_on":["[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheafification-idempotence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheafification-idempotence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Sheafification is Idempotent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,\\eta)\">\\((a,\\eta)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a> 的层化函子数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 为包含函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_F:F\\to iaF\">\\(\\eta_F:F\\to iaF\\)</span> 是其自然单位分量；同构谓词在预层范畴解释（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_{i(a(F))})\\land(\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_F))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_{i(a(F))})\\land(\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_F))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Lemma 2(ii)、Corollary 6，印刷页 131、133；DjVu 第 71–72 图页。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 已为层，恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to F\">\\(F\\to F\\)</span> 经泛箭头唯一分解，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:iaF\\to F\">\\(r:iaF\\to F\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\eta_F=1\">\\(r\\eta_F=1\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_F\">\\(\\eta_F\\)</span> 的两种分解唯一性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_Fr=1\">\\(\\eta_Fr=1\\)</span>。对已为层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"iaF\">\\(iaF\\)</span> 再应用即可。显式包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 修复把层范畴对象直接当成另一范畴输入而未说明的类型问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$(a,\\eta)$ 是 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]] 的层化函子数据，$i$ 为包含函子。$\\eta_F:F\\to iaF$ 是其自然单位分量；同构谓词在预层范畴解释（[[14-df-isomorphism]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$(a,\\eta)$ 是 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]] 的层化函子数据，$i$ 为包含函子。$\\eta_F:F\\to iaF$ 是其自然单位分量；同构谓词在预层范畴解释（[[14-df-isomorphism]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"(a,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_F:F\\to iaF","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_{i(a(F))})\\land(\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(F,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsIso}(\\eta_F))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"r:iaF\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"r\\eta_F=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_Fr=1","display":false},{"tex":"iaF","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-idempotence|Theorem — Sheafification is Idempotent]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-id